Vietnam administrative location data in this directory is a trimmed copy of
the Vietnamese Provinces Database:

  https://github.com/thanglequoc/vietnamese-provinces-database

Dataset version: v5.2.0
Latest decree in this snapshot: 388/NQ-UBTVQH16
Source file: json/simplified_json_generated_data_vn_units_minified.json

Only suggestion fields are kept (province code, name, nameEn, fullName;
ward name and fullName). GIS, postal codes, and other fields are omitted.

vietnam-locations.json is the full lazy-loaded list.
vietnam-provinces-fallback.js is the 34-province subset shown immediately, before the full file loads.

